.Dd 2026-05-30
.Dt NOMAD-INSTALL-BRIDGE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-install-bridge
.Nd install only the host-command-bridge LaunchAgent
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad install-bridge
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm nomad install-bridge
installs just the host-command-bridge LaunchAgent.
The bridge lets the admin UI run allow-listed
.Nm nomad
commands on the host, for example the Upgrade Ollama button.
.Pp
A full install already sets this up.
Use this command on its own to pick up a newly added LaunchAgent without
running a full
.Xr nomad-install 1
or
.Xr nomad-reinstall 1 .
The operation is idempotent and safe to re-run.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad install-bridge
Install or refresh the host-command-bridge LaunchAgent.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-fix-kiwix 1 ,
.Xr nomad-install 1 ,
.Xr nomad-reset-ollama 1
